  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"619\">The Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratisation (MOHRE) is the primary authority in the UAE responsible for handling labor-related matters. If you’re facing workplace issues such as unpaid salaries, unfair termination, or violation of labor rights, MOHRE provides clear channels to file a complaint and seek resolution. This guide explains the step-by-step process, requirements, and tips to ensure your complaint is handled efficiently.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"659\" id=\"understanding-mohre-and-its-role\">Understanding MOHRE and Its Role</h2>\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"875\">MOHRE is the government body that oversees labor laws, worker rights, and employer compliance in the UAE. It acts as a mediator between employees and employers to resolve disputes in accordance with UAE Labor Law.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"926\" id=\"common-reasons-for-filing-a-mohre-complaint\">Common Reasons for Filing a MOHRE Complaint</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1115\">\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"960\">\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"960\">Unpaid wages or salary delays</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"997\">\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"997\">End-of-service benefits disputes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1021\">\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1021\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/employment-contract-uae-sample/\">Employee Contract</a> Violations</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1064\">\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1064\">Workplace harassment or discrimination</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1085\">\n<p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1085\">Unfair dismissal</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1115\">\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1115\">Unsafe working conditions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1157\" id=\"how-to-file-a-complaint-with-mohre\">How to File a Complaint with MOHRE</h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1235\" id=\"gather-required-information\">Gather Required Information</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1235\">Before filing, ensure you have:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1364\">\n<li data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1269\">\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1269\"><a href=\"/labour-card-vs-emirates-id/\">Emirates ID</a> and passport copy</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1301\">\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1301\"><a href=\"/mohre-labour-contract/\">Mohre Labor contract</a> or job offer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1364\">\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1364\">Proof of issue (salary slips, emails, termination letters)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1438\" id=\"submit-your-complaint\">Submit Your Complaint</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1438\">You can file a complaint through:</p>\n<ol data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1655\">\n<li data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1474\">\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1474\">MOHRE Call Center – Call 80060</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1527\">\n<p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1527\">MOHRE Mobile App – Available on iOS and Android</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1585\">\n<p data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1585\">MOHRE Website – Submit through the e-services portal</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1655\">\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1655\">MOHRE Service Centers (Tawjeeh) – Visit in person for assistance</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1780\" id=\"attend-mediation\">Attend Mediation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1780\">MOHRE will arrange a meeting between you and your employer to resolve the issue amicably.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1916\" id=\"escalation-to-labor-court\">Escalation to Labor Court</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1916\">If mediation fails, MOHRE will refer the case to the UAE Labor Court for a formal decision.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1961\" id=\"tips-for-a-successful-mohre-complaint\">Tips for a Successful MOHRE Complaint</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2164\">\n<li data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2024\">\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2024\">File your <a href=\"/how-to-track-labor-complaint-number/\">labor complaint</a> as soon as possible after the incident</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2066\">\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2066\">Provide complete and accurate details</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2112\">\n<p data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2112\">Keep copies of all documents and evidence</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2164\">\n<p data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2164\">Remain professional and calm during discussions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2211\" id=\"timeline-for-mohre-complaint-resolution\">Timeline for MOHRE Complaint Resolution</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2361\">Most complaints are resolved within 10 to 14 working days during mediation. If escalated to court, it may take longer depending on case complexity.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2396\" id=\"avoiding-workplace-disputes\">Avoiding Workplace Disputes</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2555\">\n<li data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2453\">\n<p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2453\">Always have a written and signed employment contract</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2500\">\n<p data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2500\">Understand your labor rights under UAE Law</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2555\">\n<p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2555\">Keep a record of communications with your employer</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2573\" id=\"conclusion\">Conclusion</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2939\">Filing a complaint with MOHRE is a straightforward process when you follow the correct steps and provide necessary evidence. Whether it’s a salary dispute, unfair dismissal, or workplace harassment, MOHRE ensures your rights are protected under <a href=\"/uae-labour-law/\">UAE labor law</a>. By understanding the procedure and acting promptly, you can increase your chances of a fair resolution.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2978\" id=\"faqs-about-complaining-to-mohre\">FAQs About Complaining to MOHRE</h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3124\" id=\"can-i-file-a-mohre-complaint-if-i-am-on-a-visit-visa\">Can I file a MOHRE complaint if I am on a visit visa?</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3124\">No, MOHRE complaints are only applicable to employees with valid UAE work permits.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3264\" id=\"is-there-a-fee-to-file-a-complaint-with-mohre\">Is there a fee to file a complaint with MOHRE?</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3264\">Filing a complaint through MOHRE is free, but court cases may have associated fees.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3402\" id=\"how-can-i-check-the-status-of-my-complaint\">How can I check the status of my complaint?</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3402\">You can track your complaint via the MOHRE mobile app, website, or by calling 80060.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3556\" id=\"what-happens-if-my-employer-refuses-to-attend-the-mediation\">What happens if my employer refuses to attend the mediation?</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3556\">MOHRE will document the absence and may refer the case directly to the Labor Court.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3702\" id=\"can-mohre-help-with-disputes-over-unpaid-gratuity\">Can MOHRE help with disputes over unpaid gratuity?</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3702\">Yes, MOHRE handles end-of-service benefit disputes, including unpaid gratuity claims.</p>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I file a MOHRE complaint if I am on a visit visa?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"No, MOHRE complaints are only applicable to employees with valid UAE work permits.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Is there a fee to file a complaint with MOHRE?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Filing a complaint through MOHRE is free, but court cases may have associated fees.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How can I check the status of my complaint?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"You can track your complaint via the MOHRE mobile app, website, or by calling 80060.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What happens if my employer refuses to attend the mediation?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"MOHRE will document the absence and may refer the case directly to the Labor Court.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can MOHRE help with disputes over unpaid gratuity?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, MOHRE handles end-of-service benefit disputes, including unpaid gratuity claims.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script></p>\n\t\t\t\t",
